===Etymology===
From ''[[synchro-]]'' + ''[[-tron]]''.

===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|/ˈsɪŋkɹə(ʊ)tɹɒn/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{physics}} A form of [[cyclotron]] in which [[charge]]d [[particle]]s are [[accelerate]]d by an [[electric field]] that is [[synchronized]] with a [[magnetic field]] that keeps them in a [[circular]] path.

